  "title": "AXIL Brands and NASCAR Renew Product License Agreement Through 2027",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, Dec. 11, 2024 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company for AXIL ® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3 ® hair and skin care products, announces the extension of its product licensing agreement with NASCAR through 2027. More",
